  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atalaya na Joash",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe Atalaya nne Ahazaya hụrụ na nwa ya nwoke anwụọla, ọ gara nʼihu bido igbu ndị niile a mụrụ nʼụlọ eze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma Jehosheba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "bụ nwa nwanyị eze Jehoram,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ma bụrụkwa nwanne nwanyị Ahazaya, kuuru Joash",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "nwa Ahazaya, zopu ya site nʼetiti ụmụ ndị ikom eze, bụ ndị a chọrọ igbu egbu. O zoro ya na nwanyị na-elekọta ya anya nʼime ụlọ ndina, ka Atalaya hapụ ịhụ ya, nke a mere na-egbughị ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya na nwanyị na-elekọta ya anya nọgidere na nzuzo nʼime ụlọnsọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", afọ isii, oge ahụ niile Atalaya na-achị nʼala ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nʼafọ nke asaa, Jehoiada, ziri ozi kpọọ ndị ọchịagha na-achị narị ndị agha, ndị Karị",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "na ndị nche oku, mee ka ha bịakwute ya nʼụlọnsọ ukwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Ya na ha gbara ndụ, o mekwara ka ha ṅụọ iyi nʼụlọnsọ ukwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". Mgbe ahụ, o gosiri ha nwa eze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O nyere ha iwu, sị, \"Nke a bụ ihe unu ga-eme, unu bụ ndị nọ nʼotu atọ ga-abịa ọrụ nʼụbọchị izuike, nke otu ụzọ nʼime unu na-eche ụlọeze nche,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "otu ụzọ nʼime ụzọ atọ ga-anọ nʼọnụ ụzọ Sua, ebe otu ụzọ ga-anọ nʼọnụ ụzọ ama, nʼazụ ndị na-eche nche nʼụlọnsọ ukwu Chineke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma unu bụ otu abụọ ndị kwesiri ịga ezumike site nʼọrụ unu nʼụbọchị izuike, ga-eguzo na nche nʼụlọnsọ ukwu nʼihi eze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doonụ onwe unu gburugburu eze, onye ọbụla nʼime unu jide ihe agha nʼaka ya. Onye ọbụla nke na-abịa nso ahịrị unu, ka e gbuo ya. Nọrọnụ eze nso ebe ọbụla ọ gara, mgbe ọ na-apụ nʼezi na mgbe ọ na-aba nʼime.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị ọchịagha ndị a na-achị narị ndị agha mere dịka Jehoiada, onye nchụaja nyere nʼiwu. Onye ọbụla kpọrọ ndị ikom ya, ma ndị na-emechi ọrụ, ma ndị na-abata ịrụ ọrụ nʼụbọchị izuike, bịakwute Jehoiada, bụ onye nchụaja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O nyere ndị ọchịagha ahụ ùbe na ọta niile, ndị bụrịị nke eze Devid, ndị dị nʼụlọnsọ ukwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onye ọbụla na ndị nche ahụ ji ngwa agha nʼaka ya, ha guzoro onwe ha, nọdụ eze gburugburu, na nso ebe ịchụ aja na ụlọnsọ ukwu, site nʼakụkụ ndịda ruo nʼakụkụ ugwu nke ụlọnsọ ukwu ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoiada kpọpụtara nwa eze, kpube ya okpueze nʼisi, o nyere ya otu akwụkwọ nke ihe ọgbụgba ndụ ahụ, chie ya eze. Ha tekwara ya mmanụ ịbụ eze. Ndị niile nọ nʼebe ahụ kụrụ aka, tie mkpu, sị, \"Ka eze dịrị ndụ ruo mgbe ebighị ebi!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mgbe Atalaya nụrụ mkpọtụ nke ndị nche na ndị mmadụ na-eme, ọ gakwuru ndị ahụ nọ nʼụlọnsọ ukwu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O lepụrụ anya, ma lee eze, ka o guzo nʼakụkụ ogidi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "dịka omenaala mmemme ịchị eze si dị. Ndịisi na ndị na-afụ opi nọ nʼakụkụ eze. Ndị niile nke ala ahụ nọkwa na-aṅụrị ọṅụ na-afụ opi. Atalaya dọwara uwe ya, sị, \"Nnupu isi megide eze! Nke a bụ nnupu isi megide ọchịchị!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoiada, bụ onye nchụaja nyere ndịisi ọchịagha na-achị narị ndị agha, bụ ndị na-elekọta usuu ndị agha, iwu sị ha, \"Sitenụ nʼebe ahụ kpọpụta ya nʼetiti ahịrị unu, onye ọbụla nke gbasoro ya, werenụ mma agha gbuo onye ahụ.\" Nʼihi na onye nchụaja sịrị, \"Agaghị egbu ya nʼime ụlọnsọ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya mere, ha jidere ya, mgbe o rutere nʼụzọ ebe ịnyịnya si abata nʼogige ụlọeze, ebe ahụ ka ha nọ gbuo ya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoiada mere ka ọgbụgba ndụ dị nʼetiti",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na eze, na ndị mmadụ, na ha ga-abụ ndị nke",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Onyenwe anyị",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2KI.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". O mekwara ka ọgbụgba ndụ dịrị nʼetiti eze na ndị ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndị niile nke ala ahụ gara nʼụlọ nchụaja Baal kwatuo ya. Ha tidasịrị ebe nchụaja na arụsị niile dị nʼebe ahụ mee ka ọ darisịa, gbukwaa Matan onye nchụaja Baal nʼihu ebe ịchụ aja ahụ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.11.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
